#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: saai-knowledge.php
#: includes/class-settings.php:106
#: includes/class-settings.php:225
msgid "SAAI Knowledge"
msgstr "SAAI Knowledge"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: saai-knowledge.php
msgid "https://github.com/shinobiashi/saai-knowledge"
msgstr "https://github.com/shinobiashi/saai-knowledge"

#. Description of the plugin
#: saai-knowledge.php
msgid "FAQ / Knowledge Base / Glossary content types with a two-column KB layout, term auto-linking, and live search."
msgstr "2カラムレイアウトのナレッジベース、用語の自動リンク、ライブ検索を備えたFAQ・ナレッジベース・用語集の投稿タイプを提供します。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: saai-knowledge.php
msgid "Shinobiashi"
msgstr "Shinobiashi"

#. translators: %d: maximum auto-link dictionary pattern count.
#: includes/class-autolinker.php:468
#, php-format
msgid "The auto-link dictionary has more than %d term/synonym patterns; the shortest patterns were dropped from auto-linking. Consider trimming synonyms or splitting terms."
msgstr "自動リンク辞書のパターン数が%d件を超えています。最も短いパターンは自動リンクの対象から除外されました。別表記を減らすか、用語を分割することを検討してください。"

